"Perforation":["Full-thickness erosion → spill into peritoneum","**Sudden sharp epigastric pain → whole abdomen**","**Board-like rigid abdomen** (peritonitis), **fetal position**","Ileus, **sepsis, shock** within hours → **surgery now**"],
