"Early dumping syndrome":["**~20 min** after eating: food rushes in, **pulls fluid into gut**","**Vertigo, tachycardia, sweating, pallor, palpitations, syncope**","**Lie down**, report"],
"Late dumping syndrome":["**1–3 h**: glucose spike → **excess insulin** → **hypoglycemia** (dizzy, sweaty, confused)"],
