"Timing by type":["**Rapid** (lispro, aspart, glulisine): onset **10–30 min**, peak ~**1–3 h**, 3–6 h","**Regular**: onset **30–60 min**, peak **1–5 h**, 6–10 h","**NPH**: onset 1–2 h, peak **6–14 h**, 16–24 h","**Glargine, detemir, degludec**: **no peak**, ~24 h (degludec 24+)"],
